OL,3,ANetflix to shed 1,000 jobs in steepest
OL,4,Acuts since 2022
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetflix has said it will cut 1,000 jobs
OL,7,Fglobally as the streaming giant faces
OL,8,Fcompetition from rivals.
OL,10,FThe cuts - the steepest since 2022 -
OL,11,Fwill mainly affect its human resources,
OL,12,Flegal, product and technology teams and
OL,13,Fequates to around 6% of its total
OL,14,Fworkforce.
OL,16,FLast month, Netflix 's co-chief
OL,17,Fexecutive, Ted Sarandos, told the
OL,18,FBloomberg Screentime summit that the
OL,19,Fcompany was "not growing as fast as I
OL,20,Fwant us to".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
