OL,3,ANetflix to shed 1,000 jobs in steepest
OL,4,Acuts since 2022
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe streaming industry is going through
OL,7,Fa period of consolidation following
OL,8,FParamount's $110bn (#83.6bn) merger
OL,9,Fwith Warner Bros, the owner of HBO,
OL,10,Fwhile free platforms such as YouTube
OL,11,Fand TikTok continue to attract viewers.
